)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">90 (90)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">337 (84)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.10 (0.83&#x02013;1.47)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">VacA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Negative</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">36 (36)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">158 (40)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Positive</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">64 (64)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">242 (61)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.04 (0.85&#x02013;1.28)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote2"><label>a</label><p>Odds ratios were adjusted for smoking, alcohol, education using conditional logistic regression model.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote3"><label>b</label><p>CI: confidence intervals.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Odds ratios and 95&#x00025; confidence intervals for gastric cancer according to the CagA and VacA seropositivity stratified by <italic>H. pylori</italic> IgG</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="left"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Subgroups</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Cases No. (&#x00025;)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50